
### 1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS

### Register a New User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User (Saves JWT token to environment variable)
# @name loginRequest
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kishore@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    // Automatically capture the JWT token from response and save it as a variable
    client.global.set("jwt_token", response.body);
%}


### 2. MOVIE CATALOG ENDPOINTS (PUBLIC)


### Get All Movies and Series
GET http://localhost:8080/movies

### Filter Movies by Type ("Movie")
GET http://localhost:8080/movies?type=Movie

### Filter Series by Genre ("Sci-Fi")
GET http://localhost:8080/movies?type=Series&genre=Sci-Fi

### Search Movies by Keyword ("Inception")
GET http://localhost:8080/movies?search=Inception

### Get Movie by ID (Valid ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/1

### Get Movie by ID (Invalid ID -> Triggers 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/9999


### 3. USER PROFILE ENDPOINTS (PROTECTED)

### Get Logged-in User Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Update User Profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kishore Updated",
  "email": "kishore@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Delete User Account (Warning: Permanent)
# DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/profile
# Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 4. WATCHLIST ENDPOINTS (PROTECTED)

### Get User Watchlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Add Movie to Watchlist (Movie ID: 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist/add/5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### Remove Movie from Watchlist (Movie ID: 5)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/watchlist/remove/5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}